{"id":"js-dom-proyectos-de-practica-integradores","title":"JS - DOM - Proyectos de Práctica Integradores","topic":"javascript","topicLabel":"JavaScript","tags":["aprendizaje","javascript","proyectos"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"},{"depth":3,"text":"PROYECTO 1: Calculadora Simple (Operaciones aritméticas)","id":"proyecto-1-calculadora-simple-operaciones-aritmeticas"},{"depth":3,"text":"PROYECTO 2: Mayor o Menor de Edad","id":"proyecto-2-mayor-o-menor-de-edad"},{"depth":3,"text":"PROYECTO 3: Saludo Personalizado","id":"proyecto-3-saludo-personalizado"},{"depth":3,"text":"PROYECTO 4: Lista de Tareas (To-Do List) dinámica","id":"proyecto-4-lista-de-tareas-to-do-list-dinamica"},{"depth":3,"text":"PROYECTO 5: Quiz Simple","id":"proyecto-5-quiz-simple"},{"depth":3,"text":"PROYECTO 6: Cambiador de Color de Fondo","id":"proyecto-6-cambiador-de-color-de-fondo"},{"depth":3,"text":"PROYECTO 7: Generador de Tabla de Multiplicar","id":"proyecto-7-generador-de-tabla-de-multiplicar"},{"depth":3,"text":"PROYECTO 8: Login Simulado","id":"proyecto-8-login-simulado"}],"readingMins":3,"codeBlocks":16,"words":528,"backlinks":[{"id":"sesion-15-29-05-26","title":"Sesion_15_29.05.26","topicLabel":"JavaScript","session":15}],"html":"<h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>Colección de 8 proyectos prácticos para dominar la interacción entre JavaScript, HTML y CSS mediante la manipulación del DOM. Cada proyecto sigue la <strong>metodología de resolución en 5 pasos</strong>:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Entender el problema:</strong> Clarificar qué debe hacer la aplicación.</li>\n<li><strong>Dividir los pasos:</strong> Romper la lógica en tareas sencillas.</li>\n<li><strong>Escribir Pseudocódigo:</strong> Estructurar la lógica en lenguaje humano.</li>\n<li><strong>Programar:</strong> Escribir el HTML, CSS y JavaScript estructurado.</li>\n<li><strong>Depurar:</strong> Buscar y resolver errores.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><hr>\n<h3 id=\"proyecto-1-calculadora-simple-operaciones-aritmeticas\" class=\"note__h\">PROYECTO 1: Calculadora Simple (Operaciones aritméticas)</h3><p><strong>HTML:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">html</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;calculadora&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;number&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;num1&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Número 1&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;number&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;num2&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Número 2&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;btnSuma&quot;</span>&gt;</span>+<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;btnResta&quot;</span>&gt;</span>-<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>Resultado: <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;resultadoCalc&quot;</span>&gt;</span>0<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>JavaScript:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">javascript</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> n1 = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;num1&quot;</span>);\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> n2 = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;num2&quot;</span>);\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> res = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;resultadoCalc&quot;</span>);\n\n<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;btnSuma&quot;</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;click&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n  res.<span class=\"hljs-property\">innerText</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Number</span>(n1.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>) + <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Number</span>(n2.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>);\n});\n<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;btnResta&quot;</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;click&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n  res.<span class=\"hljs-property\">innerText</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Number</span>(n1.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>) - <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Number</span>(n2.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>);\n});</code></pre></div><hr>\n<h3 id=\"proyecto-2-mayor-o-menor-de-edad\" class=\"note__h\">PROYECTO 2: Mayor o Menor de Edad</h3><p><strong>HTML:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">html</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;caja-edad&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;number&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;edadUsuario&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Tu edad&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;btnVerificar&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Verificar<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;msgEdad&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>JavaScript:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">javascript</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> edadInput = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;edadUsuario&quot;</span>);\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> msg = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;msgEdad&quot;</span>);\n\n<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;btnVerificar&quot;</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;click&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> edad = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Number</span>(edadInput.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>);\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (edad &gt;= <span class=\"hljs-number\">18</span>) {\n    msg.<span class=\"hljs-property\">innerText</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Acceso autorizado: Eres mayor de edad.&quot;</span>;\n    msg.<span class=\"hljs-property\">style</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">color</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;green&quot;</span>;\n  } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">else</span> {\n    msg.<span class=\"hljs-property\">innerText</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Acceso denegado: Eres menor de edad.&quot;</span>;\n    msg.<span class=\"hljs-property\">style</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">color</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;red&quot;</span>;\n  }\n});</code></pre></div><hr>\n<h3 id=\"proyecto-3-saludo-personalizado\" class=\"note__h\">PROYECTO 3: Saludo Personalizado</h3><p><strong>HTML:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">html</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;nombreUsuario&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Escribe tu nombre&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;btnSaludar&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Saludar<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;saludoMsg&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>JavaScript:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">javascript</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> nombreInput = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;nombreUsuario&quot;</span>);\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> saludoMsg = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;saludoMsg&quot;</span>);\n\n<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;btnSaludar&quot;</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;click&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> nombre = nombreInput.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">trim</span>();\n  saludoMsg.<span class=\"hljs-property\">innerText</span> = nombre ? <span class=\"hljs-string\">`¡Hola, <span class=\"hljs-subst\">${nombre}</span>! Bienvenido.`</span> : <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Por favor, escribe un nombre.&quot;</span>;\n});</code></pre></div><hr>\n<h3 id=\"proyecto-4-lista-de-tareas-to-do-list-dinamica\" class=\"note__h\">PROYECTO 4: Lista de Tareas (To-Do List) dinámica</h3><p><strong>HTML:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">html</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;inputTarea&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Nueva tarea...&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;btnAgregar&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Agregar<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">ul</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;listaTareas&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">ul</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>JavaScript:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">javascript</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> input = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;inputTarea&quot;</span>);\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> lista = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;listaTareas&quot;</span>);\n\n<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;btnAgregar&quot;</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;click&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> texto = input.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">trim</span>();\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (texto === <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&quot;</span>) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>;\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> nuevoItem = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">createElement</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;li&quot;</span>);\n  nuevoItem.<span class=\"hljs-property\">innerText</span> = texto;\n  \n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Agregar funcionalidad para borrar haciendo clic en el elemento</span>\n  nuevoItem.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;click&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> nuevoItem.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">remove</span>());\n\n  lista.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">appendChild</span>(nuevoItem);\n  input.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&quot;</span>; <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Limpiar</span>\n});</code></pre></div><hr>\n<h3 id=\"proyecto-5-quiz-simple\" class=\"note__h\">PROYECTO 5: Quiz Simple</h3><p><strong>HTML:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">html</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;quiz&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>¿Cuál es el lenguaje estándar para dar estilos a la web?<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;opcion&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-correct</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;false&quot;</span>&gt;</span>HTML<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;opcion&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-correct</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;true&quot;</span>&gt;</span>CSS<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;quizRespuesta&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>JavaScript:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">javascript</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> botones = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">querySelectorAll</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;.opcion&quot;</span>);\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> quizRes = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;quizRespuesta&quot;</span>);\n\nbotones.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">forEach</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">btn</span> =&gt;</span> {\n  btn.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;click&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">e</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> esCorrecto = e.<span class=\"hljs-property\">target</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getAttribute</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;data-correct&quot;</span>) === <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;true&quot;</span>;\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (esCorrecto) {\n      quizRes.<span class=\"hljs-property\">innerText</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;¡Correcto! CSS es para estilos.&quot;</span>;\n      quizRes.<span class=\"hljs-property\">style</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">color</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;green&quot;</span>;\n    } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">else</span> {\n      quizRes.<span class=\"hljs-property\">innerText</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Incorrecto. Inténtalo de nuevo.&quot;</span>;\n      quizRes.<span class=\"hljs-property\">style</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">color</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;red&quot;</span>;\n    }\n  });\n});</code></pre></div><hr>\n<h3 id=\"proyecto-6-cambiador-de-color-de-fondo\" class=\"note__h\">PROYECTO 6: Cambiador de Color de Fondo</h3><p><strong>HTML:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">html</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;btnColorRandom&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Color Aleatorio<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>JavaScript:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">javascript</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;btnColorRandom&quot;</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;click&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Generador de color hexadecimal aleatorio</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> colorRandom = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;#&quot;</span> + <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Math</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">floor</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Math</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">random</span>()*<span class=\"hljs-number\">16777215</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toString</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">16</span>);\n  <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">body</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">style</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">backgroundColor</span> = colorRandom;\n});</code></pre></div><hr>\n<h3 id=\"proyecto-7-generador-de-tabla-de-multiplicar\" class=\"note__h\">PROYECTO 7: Generador de Tabla de Multiplicar</h3><p><strong>HTML:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">html</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;number&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;inputTabla&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Número&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;btnTabla&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Generar Tabla<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;cajaTabla&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>JavaScript:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">javascript</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> inputNum = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;inputTabla&quot;</span>);\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> cajaTabla = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;cajaTabla&quot;</span>);\n\n<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;btnTabla&quot;</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;click&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> num = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Number</span>(inputNum.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>);\n  cajaTabla.<span class=\"hljs-property\">innerHTML</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&quot;</span>; <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Limpiar</span>\n  \n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> lista = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">createElement</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;ul&quot;</span>);\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> i = <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>; i &lt;= <span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span>; i++) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> item = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">createElement</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;li&quot;</span>);\n    item.<span class=\"hljs-property\">innerText</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">`<span class=\"hljs-subst\">${num}</span> x <span class=\"hljs-subst\">${i}</span> = <span class=\"hljs-subst\">${num * i}</span>`</span>;\n    lista.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">appendChild</span>(item);\n  }\n  cajaTabla.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">appendChild</span>(lista);\n});</code></pre></div><hr>\n<h3 id=\"proyecto-8-login-simulado\" class=\"note__h\">PROYECTO 8: Login Simulado</h3><p><strong>HTML:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">html</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;login&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;usr&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Usuario&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;password&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;pass&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Contraseña&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;btnLogin&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Entrar<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;loginStatus&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>JavaScript:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">javascript</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> usr = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;usr&quot;</span>);\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> pass = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;pass&quot;</span>);\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> statusMsg = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;loginStatus&quot;</span>);\n\n<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;btnLogin&quot;</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;click&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (usr.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">trim</span>() === <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;admin&quot;</span> &amp;&amp; pass.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span> === <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;1234&quot;</span>) {\n    statusMsg.<span class=\"hljs-property\">innerText</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;¡Inicio de sesión correcto! Bienvenido.&quot;</span>;\n    statusMsg.<span class=\"hljs-property\">style</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">color</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;green&quot;</span>;\n  } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">else</span> {\n    statusMsg.<span class=\"hljs-property\">innerText</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Usuario o contraseña incorrectos.&quot;</span>;\n    statusMsg.<span class=\"hljs-property\">style</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">color</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;red&quot;</span>;\n  }\n});</code></pre></div>"}